    "description": "# PL-15: Total Sign-Ups (DLRS Rollup)\n\n_Give reps and Ops a quick count of how many completed Sign Ups a player has, directly on the record._\n\n### AUTOMATION\n\n* A Number field on Player (Total Sign-Ups) is maintained by a DLRS (Declarative Lookup Rollup Summary) rollup — not a native Salesforce Roll-Up Summary field\n\n* Counts completed Sign Ups only — the rollup's Relationship Criteria filters to Sign Up Status = Completed\n* DLRS is required specifically because Sign Up relates to Player via a standard Lookup, not Master-Detail — native Roll-Up Summary fields aren't available on Lookup relationships\n\n### IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n\n* Build using DLRS, not a native Roll-Up Summary field. Support is available if issues come up during setup.\n\n### NOTES\n\n* Provenance: new item raised in the Aug 24 Kobi/Taryn Weekly Planning sync — not part of the original Player Record User Stories doc's PL-1 through PL-14 story map. Numbered PL-15 as a natural extension.\n* Field itself (Total_Sign_Ups__c, Number, 0 decimal places, default 0) must exist on Account before the DLRS rollup definition can target it.\n* DLRS rollup definition: Parent Object = Account, Child Object = Sign Up, Relationship Field = the Sign Up → Player lookup, Relationship Criteria = Status equals Completed, Field to Aggregate = Name (placeholder, irrelevant for Count), Aggregate Operation = Count, Aggregate Result Field = Total_Sign_Ups__c, Calculation Mode = Realtime, Active = checked.\n* Run DLRS's full recalculation after activating, to backfill existing Players rather than only counting Sign Ups going forward.\n\n### SOURCE\n\n* Aug 24 Kobi/Taryn Weekly Planning — [transcript](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1qB7cUeJGFs_SZba9NX5R9MWKzOj8yTetmWTWoqY3gw8/edit), verified.\n* Dependencies: [BUILD-173 — Player: Core Details fields](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217684264652851/f/), and [✓ POC-10 — Create Sign-Up object and fields](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1216276872010067/f/) (need Sign Up's Status field and Player lookup).\n* Owner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n* Created 2026-08-21 from the Aug 24 Kobi/Taryn Weekly Planning sync.\n\n",
